{"5094940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cardsharp", "steam_appid": 5094940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5135530], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>LOSE A HAND: LOSE A FINGER</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5094940/extras/db8aca5760762241c302553ec610d2e3.poster.avif?t=1787743921\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5094940/extras/db8aca5760762241c302553ec610d2e3.webm?t=1787743921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5094940/extras/db8aca5760762241c302553ec610d2e3.mp4?t=1787743921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of your hands is held flat on the table where everyone can see it, and your five fingers are your entire health bar.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose, and the dealer takes a finger. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win, and you will be granted some cash.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>BUY ITEMS. USE THEM ON OTHER PLAYERS.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5094940/extras/8f26b54c579bd8e2b0b62d5650acd89f.poster.avif?t=1787743921\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5094940/extras/8f26b54c579bd8e2b0b62d5650acd89f.webm?t=1787743921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5094940/extras/8f26b54c579bd8e2b0b62d5650acd89f.mp4?t=1787743921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because where is the fun if you can't mess up with other players?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ZIPPO LIGHTER:</strong> burn the card an opponent was saving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CURSED RING:</strong> push it onto anyone's finger. When that finger goes, someone else bleeds with them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ROMEO'S RING &amp; JULIETTE'S RING:</strong> two rings, two people, one shared fate. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE DUCK:</strong> a gift that cannot be sold, cannot be removed, and eats one of their slots forever. You can squeak it, though.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>BLACKJACK, WITH EXTRA STEPS</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5094940/extras/2de277929c0d5993f7dd47753d6c5e65.poster.avif?t=1787743921\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5094940/extras/2de277929c0d5993f7dd47753d6c5e65.webm?t=1787743921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5094940/extras/2de277929c0d5993f7dd47753d6c5e65.mp4?t=1787743921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE CAGE:</strong> every third round a cage comes down over the table with items to buy. Spend what you won. You will need it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE PIT: </strong>a row of face-up cards in the middle of the table. On your turn you may take one. So may everybody else.</p></li><li><p class=